# 文本文件交给 Git 自动判断换行，二进制明确标记，避免无意义的 CRLF 转换
* text=auto

*.dat    binary
*.dll    binary
*.bin    binary
*.ico    binary
*.exe    binary
*.wmv    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.gif    binary

# GitHub 上 >50MB 的文件建议走 LFS，启用时取消下面注释并执行 git lfs track
# game-data/Voice.dat  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# game-data/Bgm.dat    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
